    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW US AND ADD ON WISHLIST</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/7e197d651f930a2b88bfb9a3a2fe937a.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/7e197d651f930a2b88bfb9a3a2fe937a.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/7e197d651f930a2b88bfb9a3a2fe937a.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>A LATIN COWBOY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the amazing experience of being a Gaucho, a latin cowboy, and take care of your own land. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>RAISE FARM ANIMALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without agriculture: here the focus is on taking care of your animals, from building perfect places to shelter them to breeding them so that your land can have more resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>DIVE INTO A GREAT ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside your horse and your faithful dog, explore different biomes at any time and in any weather condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>HELP PEOPLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your charisma, to unlock new paths and resources, helping residents and evolving your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/8841b77ea916ea987013cba4a8f63b88.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/8841b77ea916ea987013cba4a8f63b88.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/8841b77ea916ea987013cba4a8f63b88.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div>MYSTICAL BEINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the adventure, experience incredible missions to save the legends of Latin folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/03db0515127f3452563847e4ffd7ab66.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/03db0515127f3452563847e4ffd7ab66.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/03db0515127f3452563847e4ffd7ab66.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/7844e034d7399069a5324b890674391f.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>A LATIN COWBOY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the amazing experience of being a Gaucho, a latin cowboy, and take care of your own land. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6a293decd5dee404379b7a88c1830351.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>RAISE FARM ANIMALS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without agriculture: here the focus is on taking care of your animals, from building perfect places to shelter them to breeding them so that your land can have more resources. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/4e4a5af625172d433d51c3280af10e24.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>DIVE INTO A GREAT ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alongside your horse and your faithful dog, explore different biomes at any time and in any weather condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/6b66ce806f01b0c343c172eec862f09f.mp4?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/b3b53b3eb26808c6ebbbadb110a612ff.webp?t=1754007567\" /></div><strong>HELP PEOPLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your charisma, to unlock new paths and resources, helping residents and evolving your farm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/8841b77ea916ea987013cba4a8f63b88.poster.avif?t=1754007567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670830/extras/8841b77ea916ea987013cba4a8f63b88.webm?t=1754007567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 